efrigerator with. Wouldn't you love to see her scooping for the afternoon?\par \par \uc2 HURT: She's the Marie Antoinette of --\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: All right, Charlie, we gave her some good suggestions. Nancy, it's going to be OK.\par \par \uc2 Stay with us. We have two big announcements next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: I'll get to the big announcement about the show next week in a moment. But first, in just 10 days THE INGRAHAM ANGLE will be celebrating our five-year anniversary. Can you believe it? My team tells me that over the next few days they're going to be surprising me with shout-outs from friends of the show. What? I have no idea what they have in store, so let's check out the first one together.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE THEISMANN, FORMER \uc2 NFL\uc2  QUARTERBACK: Hello Laura, Joe Theismann here. Let me be one of many to congratulate you on your fifth anniversary. And what a spectacular job you do informing everybody what's going on in the world. You're absolutely incredible. You're a fabulous interviewer, a terrific person, and it's such an honor to be on your show. As a matter of fact, thank you so much for letting me be your first mystery guest when you had that series.\par \par \uc2 But I know it's going to be another 10, 15 years for you, because you're so good. And I'm honored to be able to wish you a happy, happy fifth anniversary. Many, many more, Laura. Take care.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Oh, my God, I'm going to start bawling. Redskins legend Joe Theismann. Oh my gosh, that means so much to me. I can't even, and I haven't seen any of these.\par \par \uc2 All right, I'm going to compose myself. Now it's finally time for our big announcement. The entire midterm season we've been focused on one theme, retaking America. And instead of keying on one particular race or candidate, we want to highlight one of the biggest shifts in modern political history. That means Hispanic voters who are fleeing the Democratic Party for the GOP.\par \par \uc2 So next Wednesday, I'm hitting the road. I'm going to Houston, Texas, where I'm going to host THE INGRAHAM ANGLE'S first Retaking America townhall, and we're going to bring you special guests and learn firsthand why this shift is taking place. So set your DVR now. Again, it's Wednesday, October 26th, 10:00 p.m. eastern. We're coming to Texas. Can't wait.\par \par \uc2 All right, that's it for us tonight. Greg Gutfeld and all the fun guys and gals there will take it from here.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document INGANG0020221021eiak00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Voters Ditching Dems as Midterms Near\b0\par\par\uc2 Sean Hannity, Jason Chaffetz, Mark Levin \par \uc2 8,266 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 October 2022\par \uc2 Fox News: Hannity\par \uc2 SHAN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 ASC Services II Media, LLC.  All materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the prior written permission of ASC Services II Media, LLC. You may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 SEAN HANNITY\uc2 , FOX NEWS HOST: All right, and, Tucker, and thank you.\par \par \uc2 And tonight, welcome to "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 All right. The countdown continues. 