ot been.\par \par \uc2 And let's not -- and you and I have also discussed the stock market.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: Right. Right. Right.\par \par \uc2 CAMPINS: The stock market also affects...\par \par \uc2 (CROSSTALK)\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: It's a big, big part of this.\par \par \uc2 CAMPINS: Yes.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: Look forward to the show, "Mansion Global," tomorrow 8:00 to 9:00 p.m.\par \par \uc2 This woman breathes real estate. She was on top of it when no one was. She was warning about the signs we saw of craziness more than a decade ago, a lot more than a decade ago. She doesn't look it. I do.\par \par \uc2 But the fact of the matter is, she's a good read this and will kind of put it in perspective on FBN. You don't get FBN, well, maybe you got to demand it, right, pretty much.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: Yes.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: We used to have people a lot louder saying that, but you get my point.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: It's an important network to watch. And Katrina is an important person to follow, as is this next fellow.\par \par \uc2 You get him for the ride too, Charlie Gasparino, I think the best business reporter on the planet. I have said that once or twice, but, Charlie...\par \par \uc2 CHARLIE GASPARINO, FOX NEWS SENIOR CORRESPONDENT: Keep saying it. Keep saying it. Keep saying it. Keep saying it. Keep saying it.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: I will. I will.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: By the way, the check should be in the mail.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: But, Charlie, I was thinking of you with the \uc2 Netflix\uc2  numbers out.\par \par \uc2 GASPARINO: Right.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: They were a little better than expected, actually a lot better than expected.\par \par \uc2 GASPARINO: A lot better. A lot better.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: And they're getting more subscribers right now. They have also got a two-tiered service to try to win people back, for cheapskates like you, who don't want