crats, unaffiliated voters. They're all coming our way because my opponent has supported the Pelosi agenda, 100 percent voting record in line with \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2 . That doesn't represent my district.\par \par \uc2 And so we are providing the alternative -- an alternative for a different way, a way that's going to help their families, make our communities safer, right, really solve our problems. And don't get me started on education. Parents are feeling boxed out of their kid's education, and my opponent has done nothing to help.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: George Logan, we'll be watching democracy in action, November 8th in Connecticut. Thanks for joining us tonight. Good to see you.\par \par \uc2 LOGAN: Thanks, Tucker. Good seeing you.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: More news, straight ahead.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: We have four seconds left. Thank you for watching.\par \par \uc2 Here is Sean.\par \par \uc2 Document TCARL00020221018eiah00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Biden Defends Relief Program Amid Litigation; Critics Argue Spending Bill Fueled Inflation; Ethics Argue Spending Bill Fueled Inflation; Former Democrat Gabbard Stumps For Republican Nominee; Democrats And Republicans Vie For Voter Enthusiasm; \uc2 Xi Jinping\uc2  Announces Military Investments Amid Taiwan Tension; Department Of Homeland Security Asking Employees From Other Federal Agency For Volunteer Work At Southern Border; \uc2 FBI\uc2  Raid In Beverly Hills Leading To Seizure Of More Than $80 Million Of Private Property Draws Controversy; Polls Show Republicans Have Advantage Among Likely Voters And Regarding Most Important Issues To Voters; Chinese President \uc2 Xi Jinping\uc2  Gives Speech To Chinese Communist Party Congress Hinting At Expansionist Ambitions\b0\par\par\uc2 Bret Baier, Gillian Turner, William La Jeunesse, Juan Williams,  Mollie Hemingway, David Drucker \par \uc2 7,946 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2022\par \uc2 Fox News: Spec