s shot, 16 and under. Just this past weekend, a three-year-old shot, a seven-year-old shot. The weekend before, three-year-old shot, another three-year-old shot. This is insanity on steroids. We shouldn't be living in a society like this because this is no society at all. There is no rule of law, and folks like Mayor \uc2 Lori Lightfoot\uc2 , \uc2 Kathy Hochul\uc2 , and a lot of other Democrats that I met on Capitol Hill, they created this systemic epidemic of violence by saying, hey, we need to defund the police. We need to create an environment where we have a cashless bail society. We need to just let the people roam free. And when they were waving me off, not wanting to answer my questions, that told me one thing, Rachel. Black lives don't matter to them. Black votes matter to them. And I'm going to be very clear about that -- they don't care. They care to win elections and that is about it, Rachel.\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: It's o interest because they are talking out of both sides of their mouth. On the one hand they're saying there is no crime wave. On the other hand, I just heard some of them say, oh, the defund the police is actually a Republican thing.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: And that is so laughable. I'm like, do they not know we have videotape of all of them, whether it's the Squad or whoever saying defund, defund? How can they think that this is a winnable way to run this country?\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: It is gaslighting is what this is. And it would be laughable if it wasn't so dangerous. If you just look at the numbers in New York, in 2021, murders up four percent, rape four percent up, robbery four, assault 11, burglary 17 percent, car theft 15 percent. Is that what the safest city in the nation looks like? It isn't.\par \par \uc2 So not I'm on a mission not just for my little brother to get justice for him, because I want justice for Christian, he was murdered on June 24th, but families across the country. So if there's anyone who knows about solutions to the violence, any viewers, please reach out to me on social media @Giannocaldwell on \uc2 Instagram\uc2 , \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , or \uc2 Facebook\uc2 . If you have a family member or someone you know who has had a horrific experience with crime and they need help in the media, reach out to me on social media, again @Giannocaldwell. We want to help families all across the country because they need it, because the people who have been elected to help them are not helping folks as they should.\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: Really quick, you spent the whole day on Capitol Hill. Was there any moment that gave you hope while you were up there talking to our lawmakers?\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: I'm going to tell you what, Burgess Owens gave me a lot of hope. I thought Kevin McCarthy had some really good things to say. But I will tell you, if I were directing or advising Kevin McCarthy, I would tell him get ready after the election to beef up your staff, because you need to send preservation notices to every soft on crime D.A. in the country. They are getting federal dollars. So Chicago, you're on notice, Philadelphia, you're on notice, California, Los Angeles, you're on notice. These folks need to know that there is going to be oversight and there's going to be punishment for the things that you're doing. You shouldn't be getting federal dollars to fight crime and you're not fighting crime. This is a major problem, and people are paying the price for it on a daily basis, Rahcel.\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: Amen, Gianno, I feel your passion. I love it.\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: Thank you so much. Thank you.\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: Thanks for joining me tonight.\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: Thank you for having me.\par \par \uc2 CAMPOS-DUFFY: Of course.\par \par \uc2 Now, when pro-lifers protests, the \uc2 FBI\uc2  comes a-knocking. Do you think abortion activists receive the same treatment? \uc2 Mike Huckabee\uc2  and Jack Brewer react next. Stay