ese to \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2  and maybe into the box pockets of \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , look at the documents.\par \par \uc2 Well, so has America's national security been compromised do the Chinese have the goods on \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 ? Are they exercising undue influence that's detrimental to U.S. interests and beneficial to the Chinese? I think that if Republicans win control of Congress come January, there's going to be a deep dive on the basis of serious national security concerns in addition to what the whistleblowers have identified as corruption at the \uc2 FBI\uc2  in burying the incriminating evidence and sealing the case and taking no action?\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Let's see if we have equal justice and application of our laws. If Hunter's last name were Trump, I think this would have been treated much differently.\par \par \uc2 Anyway, Gregg Jarrett, thank you. Pam Bondi, thank you.\par \par \uc2 Also here now with his take on all of this, and, of course, 33 days away from Election Day, we call him the great one, Mark Levin, "Life, \uc2 Liberty\uc2  and Levin", the number one show, FOX News on weekends, is nationally syndicated radio show and dear friend of mine.\par \par \uc2 Great one, how am I? Thank me. God bless us.\par \par \uc2 MARK LEVIN, HOST OF "LIFE, LIBERTY & LEVIN": Wow, you sound pretty good.\par \par \uc2 I'll tell you -- I'll give you my take on this "\uc2 Washington Post\uc2 " piece. The question is why would they put it out now? I think Pam has a very good theory. I have a different theory.\par \par \uc2 And my theory is this is old news. They could have indicted Hunter a long time ago. They're protecting Joe, of course, because they're not getting into any of the Bobulinski laptop information which is ripe for the taking. \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  is a Manchurian putative president. In my view, he's bought and paid for not just by the communist regime but others.\par \par \uc2 That said, I'll tell you what I think is going on here. This leak is numerous sources. For some reason, they mentioned \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  twice, was absolutely nothing to do with this matter. I think what they're trying to do is lay a predicate, lay a foundation, not a legal predicate, but a foundation for the American people and particularly conservatives that go on well, why don't they indict him? Why don't they indict Hunter? It's black and white, they've got the goods on him. So then we can have people say, okay, fine.\par \par \uc2 And then we have \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  say, you see, I believe in equality under the law. So we did XYZ to \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2  and now we're doing XYZ to \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . I think this is a complete setup.\par \par \uc2 I think \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2  is small potatoes. I think they're protecting \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  who obviously is more important. He's the president of the United States and they have absolutely no interest in him and by the way, neither do the media. They keep writing books about \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , like Maggie Haberman and others, who cares? What about \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and all of his ties?\par \par \uc2 But I want to talk about this election a little bit too and I want the public to understand that the United States -- the United States isn't guaranteed to exist as the United States in perpetuity. Countries are subject to demise. Athens didn't exist -- you know, fell, Rome fell, the British Empire exists no longer.\par \par \uc2 We're a country that is falling. We are a country that is facing demise as the number one superpower on the face of the earth. It's not because we voted for this, it's not because we want it, because this is what the Democrat Party wants and is doing.\par \par \uc2 This is a man-made grave assault on our liberty, on our prosperity, and our number one status as a superpower step by step by step, in every respect. Look at education, used to be first. There were no equals, now education is failing horribly. The borders wide open, that is 