2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2 , (D) VICE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: I love Venn diagrams. I just love Venn diagrams. You know the three circles, right. Sometimes there are more.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: OK, Venn diagrams.\par \par \uc2 I finally want to end tonight with a huge thank you and a happy anniversary to our fabulous director, Mike. He has been with us for four years this week. He's a major reason why this show looks as good as it does every night, even when I have coughing fits. He works tirelessly to get it all done no matter what crazy stuff we throw at him at the last minute. So Mike, thank you. Happy anniversary.\par \par \uc2 That's it for us tonight. Thank you for watching.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document INGANG0020221006eia500001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Dems Thought They Had The Perfect Puppet In Biden; The Left's Desperation Is Showing; They Built Their Opposition On A House Of Lies; The Left, Not Trump, Has Brought Us To The Brink; The Left Is True Threat To Democracy And Truth; Dems Disasters Pile Ahead Of Midterms; Dems' Decade Of Deceit Will Cost Them In November; Media Has No Substantive Critique Of GOP; Students Complain Organic Chemistry Course At \uc2 NYU\uc2  Too Difficult; Afghan Refugee In New Mexico Arrested For Sexual Assault Against Minor; New Mexico Congresswoman \uc2 Yvette Herrell\uc2  Interviewed About Flawed Vetting Process For Afghan Refugees; High School In Fairfax County,