ith all of this that is out of our control. All we can do is prep, and you know, kind of keep our fingers crossed and hope for the best.\par \par \uc2 We're going to have a call tomorrow night with my team and then we're going to decide with all of our locations that are going from Tampa all the way down to Siesta Key and, and act accordingly. It's nice that our home company, Suntex Marinas, is just we have so many resources that we can pull and bring in manpower to help fix and that's a comforting thing as well.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: Yes, before I let you go, how many restaurants do you work with that are a part of this group, that are on right on the water?\par \par \uc2 CORVALLIS: Yes, so I -- me, personally, I have five outlets and then our company in the state of Florida has multiple that could be touched by this as well. The ones that I operated; I have five from Siesta Key up to the Tampa area.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: That's a big job, and all on the water?\par \par \uc2 CORVALLIS: Yes, we are Marina Bay's company. So, everyone has a Marina and some have restaurants and some don't.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: All right. Great guy, we hope you make out well. And we're glad to speak with you today we'll be thinking about you and your all your employees as we watch this thing as it moves. Stay safe, all of you, and thanks for your time today. Good to have you with us.\par \par \uc2 CORVALLIS: Appreciate it. Thank you.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: You bet. All right, so the other big story right now as we hurdle towards these midterm elections is this one which is Georgia. Where are they could, based on the numbers right now, it's possible this race could again in Georgia be headed for a runoff. Dana Perino and Joe Concha, also, Republican Tiffany Smiley as we zero in on these races, she is running to stop a sixth term for Democrats Senator \uc2 Patty Murray\uc2 , who has been well entrenched in Washington State. We'll talk to her next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BRE