challenging it is to be able to bring law and order to a dangerous city.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Well, I'll tell you right now, the people of Pennsylvania deserve a debate before voting starts. Voting starts Monday. You can't have it the week before the election. He doesn't get to hide in his basement bunker like \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 . Frankly like \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  on steroids and human growth hormone in terms of hiding. I've never seen anything like it.\par \par \uc2 Dr. Oz, thank you.\par \par \uc2 When we come back, John Solomon breaking bomb shell report on \uc2 FBI\uc2  abuse of power, you don't want to miss it, straight ahead this Friday night.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right. Big breaking news from John Solomon tonight, reporting that GOP lawmakers and \uc2 FBI\uc2  experts are now calling for a Church-like commission to investigation \uc2 FBI\uc2 , how it's been politicized, the bias, the abuse of power.\par \par \uc2 Now, remember, the Church committee was a U.S. Senate Select Committee lead by Frank Church. This happened in the mid-1970s and they found abuses by the CIA and the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , and the intelligence community that undermine Americans' constitutional rights.\par \par \uc2 Now, also, developing tonight, even more evidence of intelligence failures in the days leading up to January 6, and many whistleblowers keep coming forward.\par \par \uc2 Here with reaction, investigative reporter and the editor in chief of Justthenews.com, the founder, John Solomon, along with FOX News contributor Jason Chaffetz.\par \par \uc2 John, let's start with the news. What have you found?\par \par \uc2 JOHN SOLOMON, FOUNDER, JUSTTHENEWS.COM: Yeah, first up, Congressman Rodney Davis, ranking Republican on the House Administration Committee, committee that overseas capital security, after we broke the story on your show Tuesday tonight that there was a whistle blower named Eric Core (ph), saying they had all the intelligence warning there was going to be a riot on January 6. Didn't prepare it.\par \par \uc2 He now has confirmed all there are multiple \uc2 Capitol police\uc2  officers that have come forward, sought whistleblower protection, and alleged the exact same thing, that intelligence was ignored, this event could have been prevented with more resources, more planning, more equipment, and maybe even accepting the National Guard that President Trump had offered through the Pentagon. We hear as many as 10 whistleblowers is what we're hearing tonight.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Wow, that's a big story.\par \par \uc2 Let me go to you, Jason Chaffetz. I know you know Michael Horowitz. I know you stay in touch. You've been hearing about the 20-plus \uc2 FBI\uc2  whistle blowers talking about how has been politicized, how there's an abuse of power. Many like myself are worried the DOJ has been weaponized on top of all of that.\par \par \uc2 Do you care a Church-like committee is necessary based on what the whistleblowers are now beginning to say? And look at this Danchenko trial that going on. Here is a guy that was Christopher Steele's source, then he's getting paid by the \uc2 FBI\uc2  for the better part of 2017 through 2020.\par \par \uc2 Why are they paying a Russian informant that lied in that dossier? That dossier was based on everything he said.\par \par \uc2 JASON CHAFFETZ, FOX NEWS CONTRIBUTOR: Yeah, count me as a big supporters of this type of thing. Look, the director of the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , Wray, was brought in to be an agent of change. He's not been.\par \par \uc2 There are now thousands of pages from the inspector general highlighting the political bias within the organization. The infestation of politics, the rank partisanship that's going on there, you're not going to clean this place up until you change out the leadership. But it's going to take something like a Church type commission to go in there.\par \par \uc2 You don't need just a whistleblowers. You can look at the inspector general. You can look at the people who are retiring from the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , telling us these same types of things.\par \par \uc2 There has to be a wholesale change. I think as a whole the Department of Justice, 110,000 employees --\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Jason, pleat ask you --\par \par \uc2 CHAFFETZ: -- specifically at the \uc2 FBI\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Do you believe the \uc2 FBI\uc2 's politicized now, and do you --\par \par \uc2 CHAFFETZ: Absolutely, absolutely.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: -- you believe the Department of justice has been weaponized and that we have a two-tiered justice system, one for liberal Democrats and one for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and conservatives?\par \par \uc2 CHAFFETZ: It's the unequal application of justice that is well-documented through the years, it's not just against \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , it's against conservatives up and down. They do not go after anybody on the Democratic side of the aisle. And lady justice is supposed to be blindfolded.\par \par \uc2 But if you're a Biden, if you're a Clinton, if you're in a Democratic side of the aisle, they're not going to do anything. And that what's so frustrating.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: What is the status of this Church-like committee that they're talking about because that had a huge impact in the `70s, John Solomon? I wrote about it in one of my books and I think the time has come.\par \par \uc2 We've been calling this the biggest abuse of power corruption scandal in history and it took us three years. You were part of our ensemble cast, a very small group of us, and we unpeeled every layer of the onion. We've been vindicated on everything we reported. It seems like something has to happen because it's gotten worse it seems under Biden.\par \par \uc2 SOLOMON: Yeah, absolutely. First off, everything Jason Chaffetz just said is what I'm hearing from people inside the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , outside the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , and in Congress. He really hit it on the head.\par \par \uc2 Jim Jordan, I had a