rs like Michigan's Gretchen witless Whitmer and California's \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  bowed down to the teachers unions. They locked those kids out of the schools.\par \par \uc2 And now, we're seeing the academic and mental health ruin that this selfishness caused. But at least this angelic woman is happy.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: Where's the education pieces here? Where's the education pieces here? Climate change, if we actually stop these extreme weather events.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: She's an extreme weather event. That's terrifying. Hadn't seen that before.\par \par \uc2 All right. For a year, they waived off all the concerns about inflation, these smarty pants. They went full speed ahead with their spendapaloozas. And now with prices skyrocketing for everything, Biden wants you to think that the high prices you're paying are just kind of imaginary.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , PRESIDENT, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA: The American people should have confidence that we're on the right track. That we're seeing real progress. We've worked to make sure our economy recovers to lower costs for families.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: First, has the man not seen the right track, wrong track numbers yet? I mean, it's horrible.\par \par \uc2 Second, as for those lower costs for American families, perhaps he missed this, aside from Hunter who can't, I guess, he can sell those blow pain artwork things for hundreds of thousands of dollars. Most Americans are really, really hurting, Joe.\par \par \uc2 And Biden's cabinet, well, it's teaming as we know with far-left halfwits. And America has spent over $40 billion in Ukraine. But Biden, he wants to spend $11.7 billion more. Have you heard that? And this, this is Secretary of Energy's takeaway from that.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER GRANHOLM\uc2 , SECRETARY OF ENERGY: It has 